  "description": "The C# port of indra-ocr's core: the ONNX Runtime inference engine and the whole OCR\npipeline (detection, recognition, orientation, reading order, layout), plus everything that works on\nthe pages it produces: the text layer's runs and the verdict on them, the reading order, the layout\nand the assembled markdown. Behaviour follows the Python reference bit for bit; only timings and\nfloats below 1e-3 differ. The models are not bundled: they are downloaded at runtime from\nhttps://huggingface.co/datalab-to/indra-ocr and are licensed under a modified OpenRAIL-M licence, not\nApache-2.0 (see NOTICE).",
